    <h2>6. Advertising</h2>
    <p>The Site is supported by advertising, including Google AdSense. We do not control and are not responsible for the content of third-party ads. Your interactions with advertisers are solely between you and them.</p>

    <h2>7. Third-party links</h2>
    <p>The Site links to external websites we do not control. We are not responsible for their content, policies, or practices.</p>

    <h2>8. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>The Site is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, express or implied. To the fullest extent permitted by law, TransferHub is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages, or for any loss arising from your use of, or reliance on, the Site or its content.</p>

    <h2>9. Indemnity</h2>
    <p>You agree to indemnify TransferHub against claims arising from your misuse of the Site or breach of these Terms.</p>

    <h2>10. Changes &amp; governing law</h2>
    <p>We may update these Terms; continued use means acceptance. These Terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales, without regard to conflict-of-law rules. Disputes are subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales.</p>

    <h2>11. Contact</h2>
    <p><a href="mailto:hello@transferhub.net">hello@transferhub.net</a> &middot; <a href="/contact">Contact / DMCA</a></p>
